{"id": null, "n": "0002001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0002001", "type": "orig", "text": "在漢譯經典有一切入，舉地、水、火、風、青、黃、赤、白、空無邊處、識無邊處之十徧處定。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0003001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0003001", "type": "orig", "text": "Suttanipāta，同於 Mahāmangalasutta（漢譯南傳藏、二七卷參照）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0004002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0004002", "type": "orig", "text": "云得、不得、毀、譽、稱、譏、苦、樂之八法。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0004001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0004001", "type": "orig", "text": "Suttanipāta，同於 Rattanasutta（參照漢譯南傳藏二七卷）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0005002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0005002", "type": "orig", "text": "云四向四果之八。四雙云向果各四。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0005003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0005003", "type": "orig", "text": "見道十五心之間斷三界之見惑，於十六心之無間成就正見得預流果者，盡七生欲界之生，云不受第八之生。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0005004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0005004", "type": "orig", "text": "云地獄、餓鬼、畜生、修羅。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0005005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0005005", "type": "orig", "text": "於北傳之五逆罪加「從他師」之一。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0007001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0007001", "type": "orig", "text": "Petavatthu，同於 Tirokuddapetavatthu（參照漢譯南傳藏二八卷）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0009001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0009001", "type": "orig", "text": "naga 之譯語，在此場合被用為使用魔術妖精之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0011001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0011001", "type": "orig", "text": "Sutanipāta，同於 Metlasutta（參照漢譯南傳藏二四卷）。"}
